OL,3,AWhy is the Microsoft outage lasting so
OL,4,Along?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major global Microsoft outage has
OL,7,Fcaused problems with emails and
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence products,
OL,9,Faffecting systems used by schools,
OL,10,Fhealthcare, courts and governments.
OL,12,FEfforts to completely resume services
OL,13,Fremain ongoing after problems were
OL,14,Ffirst reported on Thursday.
OL,16,FMicrosoft said the outage was not
OL,17,Fcaused by a cyber-security incident.
